      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": "64d402d0735a1b643865539c",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62dee57a335fab44af2fc8c1",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Edit: This may crash the headset if you open the overlay\n\nI found a way to fix lagging view. You can enable async reprojection by adding this in steavr.vrsettings inside '\"steamvr\" : {}' curly brackets. Remember to separate with comma\n\n```\n\n\"enableLinuxVulkanAsync\" : true,\n\n```\n\nEnabling this, SteamVR overlay will flicker like crazy but in VRChat the view looks good. I am rather certain this is SteamVR issue.\n\nI also tested that video players still aren't working on Linux.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
